     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi, <br></div><div><br></div><div>I would like to print 4 plots (which I have stored as variables previously) into a grid with 2 columns and 2 rows. <br></div><div><br></div><div>p1 = plot(msi1, pixel=1)<br>p2 = plot(msi2, pixel=1)</div><div>p3 = plot(msi3, pixel=1)<br>p4 = plot(msi4, pixel=1) <br></div><div><br></div><div>Basic R/ggplot functions seem not to work for variable type &quot;facet.plot&quot;. <br></div><div><br></div><div>I appreciate any hint :) </div><div><br></div><div>Melanie<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s-vOImDkBQAJ",
   "from": "kbemis",
   "author": "6033d3c0e7d242fa",
   "date": "2020-04-08T18:05:07Z",
   "subject": "Re: Print stored plots into a grid",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>See if that works.</div><div><br></div><div>-Kylie</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
